only allegation made in the show cause notices is that inputs not received in their factory but delivered directly to the job workers whereas, the department has brought additional grounds in their grounds of appeal, which is beyond the scope of show cause notices ;

they have issued challans to the job worker only after reversing the credit and the final credit was availed only on receipt of the goods from the job workers ;

the original duty paying documents issued by the principal supplier of the goods were in the name of assessee.

Issue Involved

Whether credit could be denied ?

Whether procedure employed by assessee was revenue neutral ?

